# The image build needs only the sources, manifests and lockfile (PLAN §17.3). Installed
# packages and old builds must never enter the context: the image installs and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed to build, and would bust the build cache on every change.
.git
.github
.claude
.loop
docs
*.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore

# Never send secrets to the builder (none exist; keep it that way).
.env
.env.*
